.el .ds Aq '
.TH portensor-scripts 1  "scripts "
.SH NAME
portensor\-scripts \- List and validate script plugin manifests (sidecar or WASM)
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBscripts\fR [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] <\fIsubcommands\fR>
.SH DESCRIPTION
List and validate script plugin manifests (sidecar or WASM)
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help
.SH SUBCOMMANDS
.TP
portensor\-scripts\-list(1)
List and validate script plugin manifests
.TP
portensor\-scripts\-search(1)
Search a remote script pack registry index
.TP
portensor\-scripts\-install(1)
Install a pack directory, archive URL, or registry pack into the local library
.TP
portensor\-scripts\-uninstall(1)
Remove an installed pack from the local script library
.TP
portensor\-scripts\-update(1)
Update registry\-installed packs using the digest\-pinned lockfile
.TP
portensor\-scripts\-library(1)
Print the local script library location
.TP
portensor\-scripts\-help(1)
Print this message or the help of the given subcommand(s)
